---
---

<section class="px-4 py-20 sm:py-28" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-brand-500/25 bg-brand-500/5 p-10 text-center">
      <!-- Glow -->
      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-40 w-80 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 blur-3xl"
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></div>

      <h2
        id="cta-heading"
        class="relative text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary sm:text-4xl"
      >
        Gotowy na lepsze prompty?
      </h2>
      <p class="relative mt-3 text-text-secondary">
        Dołącz bezpłatnie i zacznij budować lepsze prompty już dziś.
      </p>

      <div class="relative mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="/register"
          class="shadow-glow inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-brand-500 px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand-600 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-brand-500"
        >
          Zacznij za darmo
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="16"
            height="16"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Social proof -->
      <p class="relative mt-5 text-sm text-text-muted">
        20+ gotowych szablonów &nbsp;·&nbsp; Bez karty kredytowej &nbsp;·&nbsp; Bezpłatnie na zawsze
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
